d`` runs the job in a separate thread with its own event loop, but\nthe ``new_log_evt`` waiters live in the daemon loop. ``asyncio.Event.set()`` is\nnot thread-safe, so without hopping back onto the daemon loop the terminal DONE\nnotification is lost and ``ws_poll_info`` hangs forever (the desktop app's\n&quot;finalizing&quot; step never completes and the connection eventually drops).\n``from_threadpool`` mimics sync routes (``/update/start``), which call\n``run_command`` from FastAPI's threadpool, with no running loop.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"c752c566a72078de0bf708abde0a0f70","type":"before","name":"tmp_path_factory","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"0d399309807fd8c13a4fe8e3c68492f0","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"d529b9162dd144cb1d16e8f0ae5e4008","type":"before","name":"_no_telemetry","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"00c3f39c3e7dd2648e60563d21459d4b","type":"before","name":"_isolated_hf_credentials","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":2},{"id":"9dd6c4aaceae5fb82c91e5d6e4bd75e0","type":"before","name":"monkeypatch","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"c13bb2b04b93e5f0b6247f191602f853","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"acfb751a4a2047c4a4d5a9fb34b034f7","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"351a46ad98e3fef425855b38c8ebda41","type":"after","name":"monkeypatch::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[{"id":"3d34f736b1c00e979e09003e93d96e6b","name":"test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread[False]","fullName":"tests.unit_tests.test_bg_job_register#test_ws_poll_info_receives_terminal_status_from_worker_thread","environment":"default","status":"passed","retries":[],"start":1795005634684,"stop":1795005634788,"duration":104,"labels":[{"name":"tag","value"